#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:4
msgid "Implicit MPM"
msgstr "隐式 MPM"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:6
msgid ""
"Newton's implicit Material Point Method (MPM) solver models particle "
"materials such as sand, snow, and other granular media. Isaac Lab integrates"
" it as a Newton solver configuration, a particle asset type, and an optional"
" coupling with rigid-body solvers. MPM support and rigid--MPM coupling are "
"experimental."
msgstr ""
"Newton 的隐式物质点法（MPM）求解器用于模拟沙、雪等颗粒材料。Isaac Lab 为其提供 Newton "
"求解器配置、粒子资产类型，以及与刚体求解器的可选耦合。MPM 支持和刚体–MPM 耦合目前均处于实验阶段。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:11
msgid ""
"This page explains how the integration works. For runnable scenes, see "
"`Examples and tasks`_. For resolution, convergence, and material studies, "
"and the nearly rigid MPM limit, see :ref:`newton-tuning-mpm`."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍集成方式。可运行的场景见 `示例与任务 <Examples and tasks_>`_；分辨率、收敛性、材质参数研究及近刚性 MPM 极限见 "
":ref:`newton-tuning-mpm` 。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:17
msgid "How MPM fits into the Newton backend"
msgstr "MPM 如何接入 Newton 后端"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:19
msgid ""
"Selecting :class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.MPMSolverCfg` as the "
"``solver_cfg`` of :class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonCfg` installs "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonMPMManager`, a specialization of the "
"Newton manager that constructs Newton's ``SolverImplicitMPM``. The solver "
"represents material as particles and solves its rheology implicitly on a "
"background voxel grid. The MPM manager configures the Newton manager as "
"follows:"
msgstr ""
"将 :class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonCfg` 的 ``solver_cfg`` 设为 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.MPMSolverCfg` ，会启用 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonMPMManager` 。这是 Newton 管理器的专用实现，负责构建 "
"Newton 的 ``SolverImplicitMPM``。求解器将材料表示为粒子，并在背景体素网格上隐式求解其流变行为。MPM 管理器会对 "
"Newton 管理器作如下配置："

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:27
msgid ""
"It advances particles in place on a single Newton state rather than double "
"buffering state."
msgstr "在同一个 Newton 状态对象中原地更新粒子，而不对状态使用双缓冲。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:29
msgid ""
"It resolves collider contact inside the implicit solve. It does not use "
"Newton's collision pipeline."
msgstr "在隐式求解过程中处理碰撞体接触，不使用 Newton 的碰撞处理管线。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:31
msgid ""
"It treats rigid geometry as colliders. It is not a rigid-body or "
"articulation dynamics solver, and it does not accept external rigid-body "
"forces. Kinematic bodies are given zero mass before the model is finalized, "
"and convex meshes are passed to the solver as triangle meshes."
msgstr ""
"将刚体几何体视为碰撞体。它不是刚体或关节系统的动力学求解器，也不接受外部刚体力。模型构建完成前，运动学刚体的质量会被设为零，凸网格则以三角网格形式传入求解器。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:38
msgid "Coupling with rigid bodies"
msgstr "与刚体耦合"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:40
msgid ""
"On its own, the MPM solver advances only particles. Rigid bodies act as "
"colliders whose motion comes from elsewhere, such as kinematic pose writes, "
"and the material does not push back on them."
msgstr "单独使用时，MPM 求解器只推进粒子。刚体充当碰撞体，其运动由其他机制提供，例如写入运动学位姿；材料不会对这些刚体施加反作用力。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:44
msgid ""
"Two-way interaction uses the experimental coupler in "
":mod:`isaaclab_contrib.coupling`. A "
":class:`~isaaclab_contrib.coupling.CouplerProxyCfg` partitions one Newton "
"model into named entries:"
msgstr ""
"双向交互使用 :mod:`isaaclab_contrib.coupling` "
"中的实验性耦合器。:class:`~isaaclab_contrib.coupling.CouplerProxyCfg` 将同一个 Newton "
"模型划分为若干命名条目："

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:49
msgid ""
"a rigid entry, for example MJWarp, that owns the robot or object bodies;"
msgstr "刚体条目，例如 MJWarp，负责机器人或物体的刚体；"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:50
msgid ""
"an MPM entry that owns the particles and must set ``in_place=True``; and"
msgstr "MPM 条目负责粒子，必须设置 ``in_place=True``；"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:51
msgid ""
"a proxy mapping that exposes selected rigid bodies as colliders in the MPM "
"entry and feeds the resulting impulses back to the rigid entry."
msgstr "代理映射将选定的刚体作为碰撞体提供给 MPM 条目，并将产生的冲量反馈给刚体条目。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:54
msgid ""
"The ``mpm-two-way-coupling`` example, the ``snowball-smash`` demo, and the "
"Franka Pour task all use this pattern. See :ref:`newton-coupled-solvers` for"
" proxy and ADMM coupling, exchange modes, and tuning."
msgstr ""
"``mpm-two-way-coupling`` 示例、``snowball-smash`` 演示和 Franka Pour "
"任务均使用这一方式。代理耦合、ADMM 耦合、数据交换模式及调优见 :ref:`newton-coupled-solvers` 。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:60
msgid "Data model"
msgstr "数据模型"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:63
msgid "Configuration and USD"
msgstr "配置与 USD"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:65
msgid ""
"An MPM material is a scene asset. "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.assets.MPMObjectCfg` extends the deformable-object "
"configuration and takes a particle spawner:"
msgstr ""
"MPM 材料是一种场景资产。:class:`~isaaclab_newton.assets.MPMObjectCfg` "
"扩展了可变形对象配置，并使用粒子生成器："

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:68
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.spawners.mpm.MPMGridCfg` fills an axis-aligned "
"local box with a particle lattice whose resolution follows ``voxel_size`` "
"and ``particles_per_cell``."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.spawners.mpm.MPMGridCfg` "
"在局部坐标系中轴对齐的盒体内填充粒子点阵，分辨率由 ``voxel_size`` 和 ``particles_per_cell`` 决定。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:71
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.spawners.mpm.MPMPointsCfg` places particles at "
"explicit local positions, with optional velocities, masses, and radii."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.spawners.mpm.MPMPointsCfg` "
"将粒子放置在明确指定的局部位置，可选配速度、质量和半径。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:74
msgid ""
"Both spawners author schema-valid ``UsdGeom.Points`` simulation geometry. "
"Grid configurations still generate the lattice in Isaac Lab before authoring"
" explicit points, widths, velocities, and masses. Per-particle material "
"values come from "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.spawners.mpm.MPMParticleMaterialCfg` and are "
"authored with ``NewtonMPMMaterialAPI``. Damping [s] is authored as ``damping"
" * young_modulus`` [Pa·s]. Solver-wide settings, including "
"``critical_fraction``, live on ``MPMSolverCfg``; the schema-representable "
"ones are authored with ``NewtonMPMSceneAPI`` on the physics scene prim."
msgstr ""
"两种生成器都会写入符合 schema 的 ``UsdGeom.Points`` 仿真几何体。网格配置仍先在 Isaac Lab "
"中生成点阵，再写入各点的位置、宽度、速度和质量。逐粒子的材料参数来自 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.spawners.mpm.MPMParticleMaterialCfg` ，通过 "
"``NewtonMPMMaterialAPI`` 写入。阻尼参数的单位为 [s]，写入值为 ``damping * "
"young_modulus``，单位为 [Pa·s]。``critical_fraction`` 等求解器全局设置位于 ``MPMSolverCfg``"
" 中；其中可用 schema 表达的设置通过 ``NewtonMPMSceneAPI`` 写入物理场景 prim。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:83
msgid ""
"MPM objects are cloned through Newton replication. Grid jitter is generated "
"once in asset-local coordinates with a fixed seed, so USD clones share the "
"same local particle distribution. Use reset events or domain randomization "
"when each environment needs an independent distribution."
msgstr ""
"MPM 对象通过 Newton 的复制机制克隆。网格随机扰动在资产局部坐标系中使用固定种子生成一次，因此 USD "
"克隆共享相同的局部粒子分布。每个环境需要独立分布时，应使用重置事件或域随机化。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:88
msgid ""
"Use the same voxel size for the solver grid and particle generator. Add the "
"generated object to an :class:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveSceneCfg` like any"
" other declarative asset:"
msgstr ""
"求解器网格与粒子生成器应使用相同的体素尺寸。和其他声明式资产一样，将生成的对象加入 "
":class:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveSceneCfg` ："

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:125
msgid "Runtime asset"
msgstr "运行时资产"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:127
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.assets.MPMObject` implements Isaac Lab's "
"deformable-object interface, so scene reset, update, and state workflows "
"treat it like other deformables. Each environment instance holds the same "
"number of particles, reported by ``particles_per_object``. "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.assets.MPMObjectData` exposes particle positions, "
"velocities, and combined state in the simulation world frame through "
"``particle_pos_w``, ``particle_vel_w``, and ``particle_state_w``. The "
"deformable ``nodal_*`` properties are aliases of these. ``root_pos_w`` and "
"``root_vel_w`` are per-instance means over the particles. Position, "
"velocity, and state writers apply immediately. Deformable kinematic targets "
"are not supported."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.assets.MPMObject` 实现 Isaac Lab "
"的可变形对象接口，因此场景重置、更新和状态操作可以像处理其他可变形体一样处理它。每个环境实例的粒子数相同，可通过 "
"``particles_per_object`` 获取。:class:`~isaaclab_newton.assets.MPMObjectData` "
"通过 ``particle_pos_w``、``particle_vel_w`` 和 ``particle_state_w`` "
"提供仿真世界坐标系中的粒子位置、速度和组合状态，可变形体的 ``nodal_*`` 属性是这些属性的别名。``root_pos_w`` 和 "
"``root_vel_w`` 分别是每个实例内所有粒子位置和速度的平均值。位置、速度和状态的写入会立即生效，不支持可变形体运动学目标。"

