#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:181
msgid ""
"The implicit solve already resolves collider contact. "
"``project_outside_colliders`` adds a hard post-step correction for particles"
" that remain inside colliders; use it only when that geometric correction is"
" intentional, and not as a substitute for valid initial states, collision "
"geometry, or a stable timestep."
msgstr ""
"隐式求解已负责处理碰撞体接触。``project_outside_colliders`` "
"额外在步进后强制校正仍处于碰撞体内部的粒子。仅在确实需要这种几何校正时使用它，不能用它替代正确的初始状态、碰撞几何体或稳定的时间步长。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:187
msgid "CUDA graph capture"
msgstr "CUDA 图捕获"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:189
msgid ""
"CUDA graph capture of the MPM step is available only when the grid has "
"capture-stable storage:"
msgstr "仅当网格存储满足图捕获的稳定性要求时，MPM 步进才支持 CUDA 图捕获："

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:192
msgid "a ``\"fixed\"`` grid with a positive ``max_active_cell_count``; or"
msgstr "使用 ``\"fixed\"`` 网格，且 ``max_active_cell_count`` 为正值；或者"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:193
msgid ""
"a ``\"sparse\"`` grid with a positive ``max_active_cell_count``, "
"``grid_padding=0``, and the ``\"Q1\"`` velocity basis. The strain basis must"
" start with ``\"pic\"`` or be one of ``\"P0\"``, ``\"P1d\"``, ``\"Q1d\"``, "
"or ``\"Q1\"``. The collider basis must start with ``\"pic\"`` or be one of "
"``\"Q1\"``, ``\"S2\"``, or ``\"S3\"``."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``\"sparse\"`` 网格，``max_active_cell_count`` 为正值，设置 ``grid_padding=0``，并使用"
" ``\"Q1\"`` 速度基函数。应变基函数名称必须以 ``\"pic\"`` 开头，或为 "
"``\"P0\"``、``\"P1d\"``、``\"Q1d\"``、``\"Q1\"`` 之一。碰撞体基函数名称必须以 ``\"pic\"`` "
"开头，或为 ``\"Q1\"``、``\"S2\"``、``\"S3\"`` 之一。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:199
msgid "Dense grids and unbounded grids run without capture."
msgstr "稠密网格和未设置容量上限的网格不使用图捕获。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:202
msgid "Resets"
msgstr "重置"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:204
msgid ""
"With the MPM solver alone, automatic asset resets leave solver history "
"untouched, because worlds that share one grid cannot have their history "
"reset individually. Under a coupler, automatic resets go through the coupled"
" solver's reset, which passes the per-world reset mask to every entry, "
"including the MPM entry. Tasks that need an exact history reset, such as "
"Franka Pour, use independent MPM worlds (``separate_worlds=True``) and call "
":meth:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonMPMManager.reset_solver_state` after "
"writing their complete state. In a coupled run, this also resets the coupled"
" solver's history."
msgstr ""
"单独使用 MPM "
"求解器时，资产自动重置不会清除求解器历史，因为共享同一网格的仿真世界无法分别重置各自的历史。使用耦合器时，自动重置会调用耦合求解器的重置方法，将逐世界的重置掩码传递给包括"
" MPM 在内的所有条目。Franka Pour 等需要完整重置历史的任务，会使用独立的 MPM "
"仿真世界（``separate_worlds=True``），在写入完整状态后调用 "
":meth:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonMPMManager.reset_solver_state` "
"。在耦合运行中，这也会重置耦合求解器的历史。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:216
msgid "Rendering a particle surface"
msgstr "渲染粒子表面"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:218
msgid ""
"MPM simulation state remains a set of particles. Surface reconstruction is "
"an optional visualization pass: it does not change particle motion, "
"collisions, or material behavior. Run the teapot demo to compare the "
"available modes:"
msgstr "MPM 仿真状态始终是一组粒子。表面重建是可选的可视化步骤，不会改变粒子运动、碰撞或材质行为。运行茶壶演示可对比可用模式："

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:234
msgid ""
"The teapot demo defaults to the reconstructed surface. Select ``particles`` "
"or ``both`` to inspect the source MPM state in Newton GL or Newton RTX."
msgstr ""
"茶壶演示默认显示重建表面。选择 ``particles`` 或 ``both`` ，可在 Newton GL 或 Newton RTX 中查看原始 "
"MPM 状态。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:237
msgid ""
"Surface rendering is available in the Newton GL and Newton RTX visualizers. "
"The Kit visualizer continues to render the MPM particles directly."
msgstr "Newton GL 和 Newton RTX 可视化器支持表面渲染，Kit 可视化器仍直接渲染 MPM 粒子。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:246
msgid ""
"This recording demonstrates rendering appearance, not a different "
"constitutive model."
msgstr "这段录制展示的是渲染外观，并非另一种本构模型。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:249
msgid ""
"The teapot demo configures ``newton.geometry.ParticleSurface`` after "
"``sim.reset()`` and updates the mesh before ``sim.render()``. Its renderer "
"captures extraction on CUDA when enabled and stages the dynamic mesh inside "
"the viewer's frame lifecycle."
msgstr ""
"茶壶演示在 ``sim.reset()`` 后配置 ``newton.geometry.ParticleSurface`` ，并在 "
"``sim.render()`` 前更新网格。启用 CUDA 捕获时，其渲染器会捕获表面提取操作，并在查看器的帧生命周期内暂存动态网格。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:254
msgid "Tune reconstruction independently from the simulation:"
msgstr "重建参数应独立于仿真调节："

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:256
msgid ""
"``voxel_size`` controls surface detail and memory use. It can be smaller "
"than the MPM solver voxel size."
msgstr "``voxel_size`` 控制表面细节和内存用量，可以小于 MPM 求解器的体素大小。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:258
msgid ""
"``kernel_radius`` controls how far each particle contributes to the surface."
" Start near three times the particle spacing."
msgstr "``kernel_radius`` 控制每个粒子对表面的影响范围。建议从粒子间距的三倍左右开始。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:260
msgid ""
"``max_grid_cells`` provides fixed-capacity storage for CUDA graph capture. "
"Increase it if the reconstructed domain outgrows the reserved grid."
msgstr "``max_grid_cells`` 为 CUDA 图捕获提供固定容量的存储。如果重建区域超出预留网格，请增大该值。"

#: source/concepts/using_mpm.rst:262
msgid ""
"Anisotropic kernels preserve sheets and stretched fluid features better, but"
" cost more than isotropic kernels."
msgstr "各向异性核能更好地保留薄片和拉长的流体特征，但开销高于各向同性核。"

